This product includes software developed by the people who wrote the Go
libraries it links, the Scheme interpreter Brote (github.com/fclaude/brote,
MIT) and the typefaces its console ships. `nodwyn licenses` prints every one of
their licences, and internal/frontend/web/licenses has the same texts.

internal/catalogue/models.json is a snapshot of the model data published by
models.dev (https://models.dev, MIT, Copyright (c) 2025 models.dev).

The console's monospace typeface, Nodwyn Console Mono, is a subset of IBM Plex
Mono (SIL Open Font License 1.1, Copyright 2017 IBM Corp.), renamed because the
licence reserves the name Plex for the unmodified font.
